        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ornella Fiorentini\n- Places: Ravenna, Province of Ravenna, Emilia-Romagna, Northern Italy\n- Roles: poet, writer\n- Organizations: Ostrogothic Kingdom, Eastern Roman (Byzantine) Empire\n\nFacts:\n- Ravenna later served as the capital of the Ostrogothic Kingdom.\n- In 540, the Eastern Roman (Byzantine) Empire re-conquered Ravenna.\n- Ravenna is the capital city of the Province of Ravenna in the Emilia-Romagna region of Northern Italy.\n- Ornella Fiorentini is an Italian poet and writer born in Ravenna, Italy.\n- Ornella Fiorentini lives and works in Ravenna, Italy.",
